{"id":"vod_bf_25689","vodId":"25689","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"潘朵拉之心","name_cn":"潘朵拉之心","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-26/9c130014c6eb0fed5af9332f9e75a335.jpg"},"summary":"世界被四大公爵家族所掌控着，奥兹（皆川纯子 配音）是萨流士家的下一任当家，然而，在十五岁成人仪式上，他却因为“存在”这种莫名其妙的理由被定罪，之后被投入了永远不得超生的阿鬼茨监狱之中。在监狱里，奥兹遇见了被称为“染血黑兔”的艾莉丝（小野大辅 配音），在艾莉丝的帮助之下，奥兹成功的逃出了监狱，并意外的回到了十年之前。　　重新获得自由之后，奥兹决定查明整个事件的真相，揪出想要抹杀他存在的幕后真凶。在此过程中，艾莉丝在奥兹的帮助之下亦试图寻回他失落的记忆。两人来到了传说中的禁忌之地，究竟有怎样的秘密隐藏在那里呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:58:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/panduolazhixin/第14集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集